    number: "14",
    title: "NO FEAR: Anger & Lust (PROD. @east303buddy)",
    youtubeId: "78sekf580CE",
    layer: 'self',
    type: 'poem',
    pullQuote: "I'm alive.",
    content: `Fear is poison
pain and pleasure
Some people get off on it
I try to stay away.
Only place I'm comfortable is isolation.
Truthfully.

I'm alive.`
