<BaseLayout title="The Art of Survival — Work" theme="work">
  <div class="survival-entry">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Back to Work</a>
    <h1 class="survival-title">The Art of Survival</h1>
    <p class="survival-meta">2023 · Published · Digital Art, Music Production, Poetry</p>
    <img src="/images/work/art-of-survival/isolation.jpg" alt="The Art of Survival" class="cover-image" width="1200" height="400" />

    <div class="intro">
      <p>The Art Of Survival is a collection of biographical and sometimes fantastical digital art and music that represents what survival feels like for me, a kid from Newark NJ, when I removed myself from my family, living on my own during my junior and senior year of college.</p>
      <p>Each experience was a novel attempt in expressing my experience. I had no skill with digital art prior to starting. I downloaded Instagram and just started creating with visuals, some of my music, and music that mattered to me in the moment.</p>
      <p>The story is one of generational curses and is my attempt at trying to understand and grow into the person I want to become: an artist, a leader, a better lover, and a better person.</p>

      <div class="layers-key">
        <span class="layer-key layer-key--self">Self-care</span>
        <span class="layer-key layer-key--confidence">Confidence</span>
        <span class="layer-key layer-key--community">Community</span>
        <span class="layer-key layer-key--love">Love</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pieces-container">
      {pieces.map((piece) => (
        <div class={`piece piece--${piece.type} piece--layer-${piece.layer}`}>

          {/* Title-only pieces — no video, no text */}
          {piece.type === 'title' && (
            <div class="piece__gap">
              <span class="piece__gap-number">{piece.number}.</span>
              <span class="piece__gap-title">{piece.title}</span>
              {piece.youtubeId && (
                <iframe
                  src={`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${piece.youtubeId}`}
                  title={piece.title}
                  allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                  allowfullscreen
                  class="piece__gap-video"
                ></iframe>
              )}
            </div>
          )}

          {/* Poem pieces — centered column */}
          {piece.type === 'poem' && (
            <div class="piece__poem-wrap">
              <div class="piece__poem-header">
                <span class={`piece__layer-tag piece__layer-tag--${piece.layer}`}>{layerLabels[piece.layer]}</span>
                <span class="piece__number">{piece.number}.</span>
                <h2 class="piece__title">{piece.title}</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="piece__poem-body">
                {piece.youtubeId && (
                  <div class="piece__poem-video">
                    <iframe
                      src={`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${piece.youtubeId}`}
                      title={piece.title}
                      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                      allowfullscreen
                    ></iframe>
                  </div>
                )}
                <div class="piece__poem-text">
                  {piece.content.split('\n').map((line) => (
                    <p>{line || <>&nbsp;</>}</p>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              {piece.pullQuote && (
                <div class="piece__pull-quote">
                  <p>{piece.pullQuote}</p>
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          )}

          {/* Prose pieces — full split layout */}
          {piece.type === 'prose' && (
            <div class="piece__prose-wrap">
              <div class="piece__prose-header">
                <span class={`piece__layer-tag piece__layer-tag--${piece.layer}`}>{layerLabels[piece.layer]}</span>
                <span class="piece__number">{piece.number}.</span>
                <h2 class="piece__title">{piece.title}</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="piece__prose-grid">
                <div class="piece__prose-video">
                  {piece.youtubeId && (
                    <iframe
                      src={`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${piece.youtubeId}`}
                      title={piece.title}
                      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                      allowfullscreen
                    ></iframe>
                  )}
                </div>
                <div class="piece__prose-text">
                  {piece.content.split('\n').map((line) => (
                    <p>{line || <>&nbsp;</>}</p>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              {piece.pullQuote && (
                <div class="piece__pull-quote piece__pull-quote--prose">
                  <p>{piece.pullQuote}</p>
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          )}

        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="outro">
      <p class="outro__statement">I was completely alone for the first time in my own life.</p>
      <div class="outro__body">
        <p>The isolation project is an amalgamation of digital art and music that I, Angel Suero, created while living alone in my own apartment during the years of 2021–2023.</p>
        <p>I didn't trust any of my tight-knit family to lean on. I broke up with my long term girlfriend in a grim and messy way. I had removed myself from many of the mutual friends we shared.</p>
        <p>That was as immensely scary as it was eye-opening to who I really am.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="outro__credit"><em>Originally created for Roy Nathanson's Spring 2023 arts workshop "Creating a Full-Length Text/Music Performance and Recording."</em></p>
    </div>
  </div>

